<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><document id="166980" schemaversion="1.4" date="2026-09-09T15:02:39+10:00" version="current" level="processed" position="1" publicationid="ebl1-syst-port-3u4v"><documentinfo><uri id="166980" external="false" mediatype="application/vnd.pageseeder.psml+xml" created="2026-09-09T15:02:39+10:00" modified="2026-09-09T15:02:39+10:00" scheme="http" host="pr.localhost" port="80" path="/ps/epub/local1/documents/system_report/components/system_report-08.psml" decodedpath="/ps/epub/local1/documents/system_report/components/system_report-08.psml" title="Overall Description"><displaytitle>Overall Description</displaytitle></uri><reversexrefs><reversexref uriid="167013" href="../system_report.psml" frag="content" urititle="System Report" mediatype="application/vnd.pageseeder.psml+xml" documenttype="references" id="719622" title="" type="none" forwardtype="embed" forwardtitle="Overall Description" forwarddisplay="document" forwardfrag="default" level="1"/></reversexrefs></documentinfo><fragmentinfo structure-modified="2019-09-10T11:43:43+10:00"/><metadata/><section id="166980-title"><fragment id="166980-title"><heading level="1" numbered="true" prefix="2.1" id="166980-1-title-1">Overall Description</heading></fragment></section><section id="166980-body"><fragment id="166980-1-1"><para>This section should briefly describe what the system is. It should specify the scope of the system (ie. what it includes and what it does not include). This section can also be used to provide background information about the system which will make the requirements easier to understand (eg. is this a new system or is it a redevelopment of an existing).</para></fragment></section></document>